{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-jsx","path":"/Spring AOP/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wonyu"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"75ac2b4e-2346-5bc3-925c-9dd8570d5320","excerpt":"✅ AOP(Aspect Oriented Programming)은 핵심 비즈니스 로직이 아닌 공통적인 부가적인 관심사(로깅, 보안, 트랜잭션 관리 등)를 분리하여 코드의 유지보수성을 높이는 프로그래밍 기법 📌 핵심 개념 용어 설명 Aspect 공통 관심사(로깅, 트랜잭션, 보안 등)를 모듈화한 객체 Advice 특정 JoinPoint에서 실행될 코드 (Be…","html":"<p>✅ <strong>AOP(Aspect Oriented Programming)은 핵심 비즈니스 로직이 아닌 공통적인 부가적인 관심사(로깅, 보안, 트랜잭션 관리 등)를 분리하여 코드의 유지보수성을 높이는 프로그래밍 기법</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"-핵심-개념\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-%ED%95%B5%EC%8B%AC-%EA%B0%9C%EB%85%90\" aria-label=\" 핵심 개념 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 핵심 개념</strong></h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>용어</strong></th>\n<th><strong>설명</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Aspect</strong></td>\n<td>공통 관심사(로깅, 트랜잭션, 보안 등)를 <strong>모듈화한 객체</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Advice</strong></td>\n<td>특정 JoinPoint에서 <strong>실행될 코드</strong> (Before, After, Around 등)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>JoinPoint</strong></td>\n<td>Advice가 <strong>실행될 수 있는 지점</strong> (메서드 실행 시점 등)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Pointcut</strong></td>\n<td>JoinPoint 중에서 <strong>Advice를 적용할 대상을 정의하는 표현식</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Weaving</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Advice를 실제 대상 객체에 적용하는 과정</strong> (컴파일 타임, 런타임 등)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"-Spring-AOP의-주요-Advice-종류\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-Spring-AOP%EC%9D%98-%EC%A3%BC%EC%9A%94-Advice-%EC%A2%85%EB%A5%98\" aria-label=\" Spring AOP의 주요 Advice 종류 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 Spring AOP의 주요 Advice 종류</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>✅ 오류 확률 감소와 간결한 코드를 위해 최소한의 유형 선택 권장</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Advice 유형</strong></th>\n<th><strong>설명</strong></th>\n<th><strong>예제</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Before</strong></td>\n<td>대상 메서드 실행 <strong>전</strong> 실행</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">@Before(\"execution(* com.example..*(..))\")</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>After Returning</strong></td>\n<td>대상 메서드 실행 <strong>후</strong> (예외 발생 X) 실행</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">@AfterReturning(\"execution(* com.example..*(..))\")</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>After Throwing</strong></td>\n<td>대상 메서드 실행 중 예외 발생 시 실행</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">@AfterThrowing(\"execution(* com.example..*(..))\")</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>After (Finally)</strong></td>\n<td>대상 메서드 실행 <strong>완료 후</strong> (성공/실패 상관없음) 실행</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">@After(\"execution(* com.example..*(..))\")</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Around</strong></td>\n<td>대상 메서드 실행 <strong>전/후</strong> 모두 실행 (가장 강력함)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">@Around(\"execution(* com.example..*(..))\")</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>🔹 AOP 동작 순서</strong>  </p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"text\"><pre class=\"language-text\"><code class=\"language-text\">1️⃣ @Around 실행 (메서드 실행 전)  \n2️⃣ @Before 실행  \n3️⃣ 대상 메서드 실행  \n4️⃣ @AfterReturning 실행 (정상 종료 시)  \n5️⃣ @AfterThrowing 실행 (예외 발생 시)  \n6️⃣ @After 실행 (무조건 실행)  \n7️⃣ @Around 실행 (메서드 실행 후)  </code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"-Spring-AOP-적용-방식\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-Spring-AOP-%EC%A0%81%EC%9A%A9-%EB%B0%A9%EC%8B%9D\" aria-label=\" Spring AOP 적용 방식 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 Spring AOP 적용 방식</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>✅ 프록시 기반 방식과 AspectJ 기반 방식이 있다.</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"프록시-기반-방식\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9D%EC%8B%9C-%EA%B8%B0%EB%B0%98-%EB%B0%A9%EC%8B%9D\" aria-label=\"프록시 기반 방식 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>프록시 기반 방식</strong></h3>\n<p>✅ <strong>Spring이 기본적으로 제공하는 AOP 방식</strong><br>\n✅ <strong>런타임에 프록시 객체를 생성하여 AOP 기능을 적용</strong><br>\n✅ <strong>스프링 컨테이너에서 관리하는 빈에만 적용 가능</strong></p>\n<p><strong>🔹 동작 방식</strong>  </p>\n<ul>\n<li>JDK 동적 프록시: 인터페이스가 있는 경우, <code class=\"language-text\">java.lang.reflect.Proxy</code>를 이용해 프록시 생성</li>\n<li>CGLIB 프록시(클래스 기반): 인터페이스가 없는 경우, CGLIB 라이브러리를 사용해 바이트코드 조작으로 프록시 생성</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>🔹 프록시 동작 방식</strong><br>\nAOP 없이 Spring 빈을 실행시키면, 아래와 같이 실행될 것이다.\n<span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/a8a8cf9c231a2cbf88a4c4ce179885cf/77dcf/without-proxy.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 40.588235294117645%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='without proxy' title='' src='/static/a8a8cf9c231a2cbf88a4c4ce179885cf/ca1dc/without-proxy.png' srcset='/static/a8a8cf9c231a2cbf88a4c4ce179885cf/e7570/without-proxy.png 170w,\n/static/a8a8cf9c231a2cbf88a4c4ce179885cf/f46e7/without-proxy.png 340w,\n/static/a8a8cf9c231a2cbf88a4c4ce179885cf/ca1dc/without-proxy.png 680w,\n/static/a8a8cf9c231a2cbf88a4c4ce179885cf/77dcf/without-proxy.png 930w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n만약 AOP를 활용하면, Spring 빈은 아래와 같이 실행된다.\n<span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/dbac84cda5778c5ee7212297a69191ff/5cfe2/with-proxy.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 37.64705882352941%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='with proxy' title='' src='/static/dbac84cda5778c5ee7212297a69191ff/ca1dc/with-proxy.png' srcset='/static/dbac84cda5778c5ee7212297a69191ff/e7570/with-proxy.png 170w,\n/static/dbac84cda5778c5ee7212297a69191ff/f46e7/with-proxy.png 340w,\n/static/dbac84cda5778c5ee7212297a69191ff/ca1dc/with-proxy.png 680w,\n/static/dbac84cda5778c5ee7212297a69191ff/5cfe2/with-proxy.png 1006w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span>\nPOJO를 구현한 AOP 프록시 객체가 클라이언트 요청을 받아 foo() 실행 전/후 advice를 실행하는 것이다.</p>\n<p><strong>🔹 프록시 생성 방식</strong><br>\nSpring AOP는 <code class=\"language-text\">AnnotationAwareAspectJAutoProxyCreator</code>라는 <strong>BeanProcessor의</strong> 구현체를 사용해 AOP 프록시를 생성한다.</p>\n<p><span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/f5827a367374763565460575f8971332/0f09d/post-processor.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 43.529411764705884%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='post processor' title='' src='/static/f5827a367374763565460575f8971332/ca1dc/post-processor.png' srcset='/static/f5827a367374763565460575f8971332/e7570/post-processor.png 170w,\n/static/f5827a367374763565460575f8971332/f46e7/post-processor.png 340w,\n/static/f5827a367374763565460575f8971332/ca1dc/post-processor.png 680w,\n/static/f5827a367374763565460575f8971332/02d09/post-processor.png 1020w,\n/static/f5827a367374763565460575f8971332/9d567/post-processor.png 1360w,\n/static/f5827a367374763565460575f8971332/0f09d/post-processor.png 1652w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span>\n1️⃣ Spring 컨테이너가 Spring 빈을 생성<br>\n2️⃣ <code class=\"language-text\">BeanPostProcessor</code> (<code class=\"language-text\">AnnotationAwareAspectJAutoProxyCreator</code>)가 빈을 감지<br>\n3️⃣ AOP 적용 대상이면 프록시 객체를 생성하여 빈으로 등록<br>\n4️⃣ 클라이언트가 Spring 빈을 호출하면 프록시가 먼저 실행됨<br>\n5️⃣ 프록시가 AOP Advice(Before, After 등)를 실행한 후, 원래 메서드를 실행  </p>\n<p><strong>테스트 코드</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@SpringBootTest</span>  \n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">MyServiceTest</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n  \n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Autowired</span>  \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">MyService</span> myService<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n  \n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Test</span>  \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">testAopProxyType</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n        <span class=\"token function\">assertThat</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>myService<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getClass</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">isEqualTo</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">MyService</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>  \n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>결과</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"text\"><pre class=\"language-text\"><code class=\"language-text\">필요:com.example.my.MyService\n실제:com.example.my.MyService$$SpringCGLIB$$0</code></pre></div>\n<p>Spring AOP가 적용된 MyService의 빈 객체를 확인해보면, 프록시 객체가 감싸진 것을 확인할 수 있다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"AspectJ-기반-방식\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#AspectJ-%EA%B8%B0%EB%B0%98-%EB%B0%A9%EC%8B%9D\" aria-label=\"AspectJ 기반 방식 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>AspectJ 기반 방식</strong></h3>\n<p>✅ <strong>Spring AOP보다 더 강력한 AOP 방식</strong><br>\n✅ <strong>컴파일 타임 또는 로드 타임에 바이트코드를 수정하여 AOP 적용</strong><br>\n✅ <strong>Spring Bean이 아닌 일반 객체에도 AOP 적용 가능</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"-예제\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-%EC%98%88%EC%A0%9C\" aria-label=\" 예제 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 예제</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>🔹 기본적인 Aspect 모듈</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Aspect</span>\n<span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Component</span>\n<span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Slf4j</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">LoggingAspect</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  <span class=\"token comment\">// Aspect</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@AfterReturning</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"execution(* com.example.my..*(..))\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\">// Pointcut</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">afterMethodExecution</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">JoinPoint</span> joinPoint<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  <span class=\"token comment\">// Advice</span>\n        log<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">info</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"✅ service 실행 완료: \"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>🔹 포인트컷 분리</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Aspect</span>\n<span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Component</span>\n<span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Slf4j</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">LoggingAspect</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  <span class=\"token comment\">// Aspect</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Pointcut</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"execution(* com.example.my..*(..))\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\">// Pointcut</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">myMethods</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@AfterReturning</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"myMethods()\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">afterMethodExecution</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">JoinPoint</span> joinPoint<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  <span class=\"token comment\">// Advice</span>\n        log<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">info</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"✅ service 실행 완료: \"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"-참고\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-%EC%B0%B8%EA%B3%A0\" aria-label=\" 참고 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 참고</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/core/aop.html\">https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/core/aop.html</a></p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Spring AOP","date":"March 03, 2025","update":"March 03, 2025","tags":["Spring"],"series":"Spring 기초 이해"},"fields":{"slug":"/Spring AOP/","readingTime":{"minutes":4.875}}},"seriesList":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"ce176831-2da9-5cc0-a6b1-e2cbcfe4f0a0","fields":{"slug":"/WAS와 Servlet/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"WAS와 Servlet"}}},{"node":{"id":"7eedce63-46d2-5594-8da2-2be92a40f2e6","fields":{"slug":"/DispatcherServlet의 동작 과정/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"DispatcherServlet의 동작 과정"}}},{"node":{"id":"5f1a2e65-bd7b-5447-9d1d-8cf9d88a7d21","fields":{"slug":"/IoC Container/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"IoC Container"}}},{"node":{"id":"0805ba38-d23a-51c5-8cd0-a24b00a07145","fields":{"slug":"/Spring Filter & Interceptor/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Filter & Interceptor"}}},{"node":{"id":"a34f7e04-a092-5e68-8da5-5d4f8a6bf33b","fields":{"slug":"/Spring 예외 처리/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Spring 예외 처리"}}},{"node":{"id":"75ac2b4e-2346-5bc3-925c-9dd8570d5320","fields":{"slug":"/Spring AOP/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Spring AOP"}}}]},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/Spring 예외 처리/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Spring 예외 처리"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/TDD 개요/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"TDD 개요"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"75ac2b4e-2346-5bc3-925c-9dd8570d5320","series":"Spring 기초 이해","previousPostId":"a34f7e04-a092-5e68-8da5-5d4f8a6bf33b","nextPostId":"a128a8df-b4f8-5c72-ab99-e86fdb70e115"}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}